{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing plugin dispatch-order contract.** Invocation-end hooks previously ran in registration order, so reversing them globally changes observable behavior for existing multi-plugin configurations and can invert established flush or cleanup dependencies. Keep legacy ordering, or introduce an opt-in scoped-cleanup mechanism whose participants explicitly unwind in reverse.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77Ki8d","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":112,"observation_digest":"cf827df651585375bf521c711786fa9e659c692eaf0e8e140fa00bdd22b26d1a","observation_id":"aro_v1_z6bh35srlbjxlp2sdryrpbx2tz","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-08T01:57:30Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5yebu2crhve2yvxvednu65a4hs","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"14db8ae956d155999450c9262eec78bf71d38bdd","reviewer":"codex","start_line":109,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_25qwjkwdq6jg3xtuhixfn2hzq4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T01:57:30Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
